{"type":"text","timestamp":1788158831114,"sessionID":"ses_fa96e24b1ffezl65MyRkT3IS5N","part":{"id":"prt_056926321001FIUbq7t0tYU4wp","messageID":"msg_056925c64001CgVxzLlMlb2SLB","sessionID":"ses_fa96e24b1ffezl65MyRkT3IS5N","type":"text","text":"The evidence points to `auth-gateway` as the causal service: change `AUTH-2026-0318` switched tokens to issuer/JWKS namespace `partner-v2`, while validation still allowed only `partner-v1`. This propagates through `payment-api` to checkout; orders-db and CDN signals are independently non-causal. I’m writing the two reports with observed facts separated from inferences.","time":{"start":1788158829345,"end":1788158831105},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_054fa5437e1fe2fd016a95236d45e487d2977a658507d2372c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
